{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Make close gating atomic with continuation failure selection.** `close()` can set `closing` after this check but before `signalContinuationFailure`, allowing an ordinary shutdown race to select retry control and stop unrelated operations. Check `closing` and select the manager failure under the same `activeThreads` synchronization; apply the same change to coordinator rejection and add a barrier-based race test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc772zO9","finding_digest":"01549e6d2143e64fefe3915cbdad512a04d09b2f3512d27c5e2532fadf9afa04","finding_id":"arf_v1_afkj43jbipte737dsfol3lkrfi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::signalcontinuationfailure::close-admission-race","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::signalcontinuationfailure::close-admission-race","line":611,"observation_digest":"ac0be9e0ddc0af5acabdf61ead557b04176fbeaff437b5d856cd401944d37dc8","observation_id":"aro_v1_vqf6tyg5ycxvvsv56ypk2vl3aq","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_afkj43jbipte737dsfol3lkrfi","published_at":"2026-10-09T00:19:29Z","review_id":"arr_v1_uced5uhiw626ix4hlrvxazqc34","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"96356e4841da0c2c7d1ca380207d616d4c74239d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":609,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_m6b6ovrw52ao3mv6aaxlbvxxp5","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T00:19:29Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
